        },
        {
          "text": " Ka Naputali kere, ka akwap naka Epuraim ka Manase, ka akwap kere naka Yuda, kiton aŋolol nakoiŋaren; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.2",
