        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema EJAKAIT ŋes atiar, “ŋin ŋes akwap naabu keyapoik Aburaam, ka Isaak, ka Yakob, ebe, Ainakini aurikon: kesireik jo kakonyekon, konye mam idokari ŋina.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
