        },
        {
          "text": " Eleleba Yosua okoku loka Nun emoyo loka acoa, naarai edokokinit Musa ŋes akekanin: kopupenenete idwe luka Isirael ŋes, kiswamata kwape ecorakinitor EJAKAIT Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.9",
